essment projects (seismic, asbestos, fire, building Health and safety hazard evaluation etc.) for all bank premises. *  Monitor bank health and safety relative injury and accidents. Lead necessary investigation to find the root cause and deliver corrective and preventive actions. *  Lead and coordinate all internal or external audits and provide professional instructions to bank premises. *  Motivate and manage local branch colleagues to perform their duties and to attain health and safety objectives. *  Communicate with Group for standard of work, Group policy and sharing of experience. *  Ensure that all control measures relevant to the job responsibilities are undertaken to minimize the risk exposure of the Bank. *  Ensure the compliance of relevant ordinance and statutory requirements. Lead all corrective and improvement actions till closed. *  Provide comfort and safety working environment to customers and staff.\\",\\"last_updated\\":\\"2025-06-29T13:57:39.707682\\",\\"sub_department\\":\\"Quality_management\\",\\"is_current\\":true},{\\"start_date\\":\\"2005-01-01\\",\\"end_date\\":\\"2012-11-01\\",\\"company\\":\\"Philips Lighting\\",\\"company_name\\":\\"Philips Lighting\\",\\"company_id\\":2530487,\\"company_linkedin_url\\":\\"https:\\\\/\\\\/www.linkedin.com\\\\/company\\\\/philips-lighting\\",\\"department\\":\\"Operations\\",\\"title\\":\\"Facility and EHS supervisor\\",\\"highest_level\\":\\"individual contributor\\",\\"description\\":\\"*  Responsible for facility repairing and maintenance. Including ele distribution system, fire protection system, air-con system, door access system, camera monitoring system, compressed-air pipe etc. *  Responsible for construction projects. Including workshop re-layout, new production line introduction, facility upgrade etc. *  Organize emergency response training and drill. *  Set up company EHS team, establish EHS management system and pass ISO14001 & OHSAS18001certificate. *  Communicate with relative government agency, such as environment protection bureau, fire protection bureau, board of health etc.\\",\\"last_updated\\":\\"2025-06-29T13:57:39.707682\\",\\"sub_department\\":\\"Facilities_management\\",\\"is_current\\":false}]"', '"[{\\"major\\":\\"Environmental Engineering\\",\\"school\\":\\"Jiangsu University\\",\\"degree\\":\\"Bachelor\'s degree\\",\\"start\\":1997,\\"end\\":2001}]"', '"[]"', '"{\\"error\\":\\"Insufficient balance for company lookup\\"}"', '"{\\"profile_list\\":{\\"id\\":29016828,\\"name\\":\\"API Contacts\\"},\\"id\\":799590968,\\"links\\":{\\"linkedin\\":\\"https:\\\\/\\\\/www.linkedin.com\\\\/in\\\\/scarlett-luo-ba4125313\\"},\\"region_latitude\\":31.220367,\\"region_longitude\\":121.424624,\\"npi_data\\":null,\\"tags\\":[{\\"id\\":25493700,\\"name\\":\\"API Contacts\\"}],\\"current_work_email\\":\\"scarlettluo@hangseng.com\\",\\"current_personal_email\\":null}"', null, null, null, '2025-07-29 16:56:44', '2025-07-29 16:56:44', null);
