 operation of Beijing Branch. Lead operation department which includes Trade Finance, Loan Administration, Cash Operations, Remittance and Gerntal Administation. Establish the internal operation monitoring process to minimize operational risks. Lead the team to deliver efficient and quality services to both external and internal customer. Provide operation guidance to  4 sub-branches In charge of compliance of the government and central bank policy and requirements. In charge of Business operation contingency System of Beijing Branch. Define Operation department strategy optimize the process\\",\\"last_updated\\":\\"2025-04-22T18:12:36.246344\\",\\"sub_department\\":\\"\\",\\"is_current\\":true},{\\"start_date\\":\\"2010-04-01\\",\\"end_date\\":\\"2011-08-01\\",\\"company\\":\\"Hang Seng Bank\\",\\"company_name\\":\\"Hang Seng Bank\\",\\"company_id\\":20179,\\"company_linkedin_url\\":\\"https:\\\\/\\\\/www.linkedin.com\\\\/company\\\\/hang-seng-bank\\",\\"department\\":\\"\\",\\"title\\":\\"Manager of Counter Operation, Beijing Branch\\",\\"highest_level\\":\\"manager\\",\\"description\\":\\"- Moved back to Beijing branch. - Manager of Counter Operations to lead three sub-functional teams: Remittance section, Cash section and Corporate services section. - The operation covers RMB and FCY business, cash and none-cash, resistance and none-resistance business. - Defined Self Training program to improve staff professional knowledge, skill, laws and regulations, each staff has training plan and to be evaluated regularly; this improved the working efficiency and accuracy significantly.\\",\\"last_updated\\":\\"2025-04-22T18:12:36.246344\\",\\"sub_department\\":\\"\\",\\"is_current\\":false},{\\"start_date\\":\\"2008-08-01\\",\\"end_date\\":\\"2010-03-01\\",\\"company\\":\\"Hang Seng Bank\\",\\"company_name\\":\\"Hang Seng Bank\\",\\"company_id\\":20179,\\"company_linkedin_url\\":\\"https:\\\\/\\\\/www.linkedin.com\\\\/company\\\\/hang-seng-bank\\",\\"department\\":\\"\\",\\"title\\":\\"Operation manager of Tianjin Branch\\",\\"highest_level\\":\\"individual contributor\\",\\"description\\":\\"From Jun 2008, I took the job rotation from Hang Seng Bank Beijing Branch to Tianjin as the Operation Manager to lead the Tianjin branch operation setup and opening Being Operation Manager to lead 3 sub-functional teams to manage and control the branch daily operations; which includes Trade Finance, Loan Administration and Counter Operation Establish the internal operation monitoring process to minimize operational risks Optimize the process for team efficiency; opened great number of products without the staff increasing. Lead the team to deliver efficient and quality services to both external and internal customer\\",\\"last_updated\\":\\"2025-04-22T18:12:36.246344\\",\\"sub_department\\":\\"\\",\\"is_current\\":false}]"', '"[{\\"major\\":\\"Investment\\",\\"school\\":\\"Tianjin University of Finance and Economics\\",\\"degree\\":\\"Bachelor\'s degree\\",\\"start\\":1994,\\"end\\":1998}]"', '"[\\"Commercial Banking\\",\\"Trade Finance\\",\\"Cash Management\\",\\"Remittance Processing\\",\\"Credit Management\\"]"', '"{\\"error\\":\\"Insufficient balance for company lookup\\"}"', '"{\\"profile_list\\":{\\"id\\":29016828,\\"name\\":\\"API Contacts\\"},\\"id\\":30386284,\\"links\\":{\\"linkedin\\":\\"https:\\\\/\\\\/www.linkedin.com\\\\/in\\\\/judy-hu-95403063\\"},\\"region_latitude\\":39.921469,\\"region_longitude\\":116.443107,\\"npi_data\\":null,\\"tags\\":[{\\"id\\":25493700,\\"name\\":\\"API Contacts\\"}],\\"current_work_email\\":\\"judyhu@hangseng.com\\",\\"current_personal_email\\":null}"', null, null, null, '2025-07-29 16:56:54', '2025-07-29 16:56:54', null);
