date\\":\\"2008-04-01\\",\\"company\\":\\"Bank of East Asia\\",\\"company_name\\":\\"Bank of East Asia\\",\\"company_id\\":38585,\\"company_linkedin_url\\":\\"https:\\\\/\\\\/www.linkedin.com\\\\/company\\\\/bank-of-east-asia\\",\\"department\\":\\"Operations\\",\\"title\\":\\"Branch Admin\\",\\"highest_level\\":\\"manager\\",\\"description\\":\\"Responsible for the branch establishment work including location selection, negotiating, contract affairs and so on. - Coordinating operational affairs of branch - Department Admin - Others as required\\",\\"last_updated\\":\\"2025-04-30T16:51:05.098510\\",\\"sub_department\\":\\"Office_management\\",\\"is_current\\":false},{\\"start_date\\":\\"2005-04-01\\",\\"end_date\\":\\"2007-08-01\\",\\"company\\":\\"Shanghai Pudong Development Bank Credit Card Center\\",\\"company_name\\":\\"Shanghai Pudong Development Bank Credit Card Center\\",\\"company_id\\":1338725,\\"company_linkedin_url\\":\\"https:\\\\/\\\\/www.linkedin.com\\\\/company\\\\/\\\\u7ef4\\\\u8428\\\\u4fe1\\\\u606f\\\\u7cfb\\\\u7edf-\\\\u4e0a\\\\u6d77-\\\\u6709\\\\u9650\\\\u516c\\\\u53f8\\",\\"department\\":\\"Finance\\",\\"title\\":\\"card operation officer\\",\\"highest_level\\":\\"individual contributor\\",\\"description\\":\\"- In charge of the Platinum Card launching and daily operation. - Leading a team to do the daily work of cards delivery, consolidating with vendors, stock management of cards and the other materials, 24H emergency card making and account maintenance as well. - In the key position of SPDB credit card center, I worked with stability and fineness. During the employment, I have completed several important projects(the Platinum Card, developing new vendors and broadening new card launching city) as leading role which promote the launch of SPDB credit card and the quality of service.\\",\\"last_updated\\":\\"2025-04-30T16:51:05.098510\\",\\"sub_department\\":\\"Accounting\\",\\"is_current\\":false}]"', '"[{\\"major\\":\\"Economics\\",\\"school\\